<title>POLAND: Forte Q4 net rises to PLN 8.0 mln.</title>
<headline>Forte Q4 net rises to PLN 8.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forte SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     8.09   vs    9.25</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 8.50   vs    7.57</p>
<p>    net profit			     7.97   vs    7.50</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Forte SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     86.41   vs   67.04</p>
<p>    costs of sales			58.63   vs   44.17</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.24   vs    0.61</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.53   vs    0.07</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.84   vs    0.95</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.19   vs    2.03</p>
<p>    investment			     6.40   vs    1.59</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		    23.30   vs   22.14</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			21.26   vs   11.81</p>
<p>    net profit			    20.71   vs   11.73</p>
<p>    net sales			    278.16   vs  223.36</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     192.40   vs  156.76</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.95   vs    1.20</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.55   vs    0.08</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   6.24   vs    6.04</p>
<p>    financial costs			7.32   vs   15.18</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
